SUMMARY:Beginner Yoga at the Vineyard
DESCRIPTION:Beginner Yoga at the Vineyard at Great Bear Vineyards in Davis Saturday\, September 12 | 9–10 AMTicket Includes: Yoga ClassStart your Saturday with fresh air\, gentle movement\, and beautiful vineyard views!Join us for a relaxing outdoor yoga class designed for all experience levels\, especially those new to yoga. Our professional instructors will guide you through the fundamentals with gentle stretches\, basic poses\, and mindful movement in a welcoming\, supportive setting.Surrounded by our organic vineyard\, wildflowers\, and peaceful morning scenery\, it’s the perfect way to stretch\, breathe\, and ease into your weekend.What to Bring:• Yoga mat• Towel• WaterAfter class\, you’re welcome to stick around and enjoy the vineyard during regular open hours. Local cheeses\, salami\, olives\, and light bites are available for purchase\, or bring a picnic to enjoy in our designated picnic area.Come stretch\, breathe\, and start your weekend the Great Bear way!
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/beginner-yoga-at-the-vineyard-8/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-Vineyards_23GBV-drone-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
