SUMMARY:Autumn Equinox Mala Necklace-Making Class
DESCRIPTION:As the Autumn Equinox approaches — that quiet moment when light and dark meet in perfect balance — I’m hosting a mala necklace making workshop in Woodland. We’ll choose natural beads that speak to your seasonal intention\, honor release and renewal\, and craft a mala that carries you into the softer months ahead. Reserve your spot today as spaces are limited! https://square.link/u/8udd2PjH
